| Command | Creates class | Invoke as |
|---|---|---|
| `frai gt analyze_item` | `AnalyzeItem::Task` | `AnalyzeItem::Task.call(...)` |
| `frai gp process` | `ProcessPipeline` | `ProcessPipeline.call(...)` |
