## Calling from Rails

If this project lives inside a Rails app, load it from an initializer:

```ruby
# config/initializers/frai.rb
require_relative Rails.root.join("lib/<%= @project_name %>/config/frai")
```

Then call from anywhere:

```ruby
result = Application.call(reviews: data, language: "en")
```

